Z||000007||Shaun41178||10-06-2001||10:21 AM||||I have been told that my car comes close to lifting the front wheels.  I think its cause my rear end squats so hard on takeoff it makes it look like the front wheels are close to lifting.  It never felt to me like the steering was light so I think they never left the ground but who knows how close they come.  I tried to get my freinds to come to the track with me to take pics to see how close I come to lifting but couldnt' get anyone to come with me.  Who knows maybe abother 30 lb-ft or  so and I would have been able to do it.<P>Perhaps Travis is close to lifting the front since he is cutting low 1.8 60' times.  Perhaps if he puts some DR's on the back and he just dead hooks off the line with no spin he just might be able to do it.||||reg||1
